<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Trattoria da Luigi - Authentische italienische Küche</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', 'Georgia', serif; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            background-color: #fbf9f6; 
            color: #3e2723;
        }

        /* Elegante Navigationsleiste */
        .navbar {
            background-color: #1b3d2f; /* Edles italienisches Dunkelgrün */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 40px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .nav-logo-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fbf9f6;
        }

        .nav-brand-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: rgba(251, 249, 246, 0.85);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4af37; /* Goldener Akzent */
        }
        
        /* Großes, stimmungsvolles Restaurant-Hintergrundbild */
        .hero-section {
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(27, 61, 47, 0.4), rgba(27, 61, 47, 0.6)), url('https://unsplash.com');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            height: 65vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 3.8rem;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 400;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .hero-section p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin: 0 0 35px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            color: #fbf9f6;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #d4af37; /* Edles Gold/Ocker */
            color: #1b3d2f;
            padding: 15px 35px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1b3d2f;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Schwebender Inhaltsbereich für das Menü-Gefühl */
        .content-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: -60px auto 80px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            border: 1px solid #e0dcd3;
        }

        .content-container h2 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            color: #1b3d2f;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 80px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #d4af37;
            margin: 0 auto 25px auto;
        }

        .content-container p {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #5d4037;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Menüleiste -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <a href="#" class="nav-logo-container">
            <span class="nav-brand-name">🇮🇹 Trattoria da Luigi</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#">Speisekarte</a>
            <a href="#">Reservierung</a>
            <a href="#">Events</a>
            <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero-Bereich mit italienischem Flair -->
    <div class="hero-section">
        <h1>Trattoria da Luigi</h1>
        <p>Tradition, Leidenschaft und ein Stück Italien im Herzen der Stadt</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Tisch reservieren</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Einladender Text -->
    <div class="content-container">
        <h2>Benvenuti a Casa</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>Genießen Sie hausgemachte Pasta, kross gebackene Steinofenpizza und erlesene Weine in gemütlicher, familiärer Atmosphäre. Alle unsere Zutaten beziehen wir erntefrisch direkt von ausgewählten Familienbetrieben aus Italien.</p>
    </div>

  <script type="text/javascript">
  (function(d, t) {
      var v = d.createElement(t), s = d.getElementsByTagName(t)[0];
      v.onload = function() {
        window.voiceflow.chat.load({
          verify: { projectID: '6a174a05da54c733c815a1e9' },
          url: 'https://general-runtime.voiceflow.com',
          voice: {
            url: "https://runtime-api.voiceflow.com"
          }
        });
      }
      v.src = "https://cdn.voiceflow.com/widget-next/bundle.mjs"; v.type = "text/javascript"; s.parentNode.insertBefore(v, s);
  })(document, 'script');
</script>

</body>
</html>
